    gap_side: top, bottom, left, or right (all 4 observed)
  ray:
    direction: outward perpendicular from gap side to grid edge
    length: 0-3 cells beyond the gap pixel (gap pixel itself is also painted)
    content: ray passes only through background pixels, never through another frame
